WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.564
This is the Daily Karma. Today’s practice is mushin: without watching yourself. Find a supported position. Let your eyes close, or rest gently on the painting.

2
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.591
Feel where your body meets the chair or floor. Soften your hands. Give gravity permission to carry a little more of your weight.

3
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:07.799
Follow the next inhale from its beginning, then the exhale to its end. Let the breath be natural, unforced, and entirely enough.

4
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:36.214
Mushin is no-mind: acting without the commentary that watches you act. Not blankness, but the quiet that arrives when self-consciousness stops narrating.

5
00:01:51.000 --> 00:02:00.613
A hand catching something falling, before the thought arrives. It was not faster thinking. It was the absence of thinking getting in the way.

6
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:30.031
Notice what your body is doing with these words. Soften around the eyes, the hands, and the belly. Keep only the effort needed to stay present.

7
00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:57.288
Notice the voice describing this practice while you do it. Do not argue with it. Let attention sit with the breath instead of the commentary.

8
00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:26.635
For a little while, I will be quiet. Let thoughts pass like weather over a wide landscape. When attention wanders, return with patience.

9
00:03:55.000 --> 00:04:04.985
Still here. Still breathing. Nothing special needs to happen. This quiet awareness is already a useful way of meeting your life.

10
00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:25.824
Do one thing today without narrating it. Wash up. Walk somewhere. Let the commentary idle and the hands get on with it.

11
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:52.799
Notice the sounds around you. Invite movement back into your hands and feet. Open your eyes softly. Thank you for meeting this day with Karma.
